[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301028161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110298#issuecomment-3301028161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110298","id":3301028161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EwbFB","user":{"login":"0xcafeb33f","id":17749567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQ5NTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17749567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f","html_url":"https://github.com/0xcafeb33f","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T02:47:21Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T02:54:11Z","body":"I ran a quick test with non-uniform and unnormalized scaling. The LookAt modification seems to work in both cases, while the TwoBoneIK seems to work with unnormalized scaling but not non-uniform scaling. [Here's the MRP I was testing with.](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22374725/test_skeleton.zip)\r\n\r\nI'll take a look this week and see if there's a way the code can be rewritten without introducing performance overhead while taking into account non-uniform scaling for TwoBoneIK. Failing that, I think it would be best to merge the fix for mirrored scales as it seems to be a more common use case (anecdotally, I initially ran into this bug when trying to flip a character facing left/right, but I cannot think of a use for non-uniform scaling).\r\n\r\nI tested a few of the other 2D skeleton modification types: FABRIK breaks for any of mirrored, unnormalized, or nonuniform scaling; CCDIK already works for each of mirrored, unnormalized, and nonuniform scaling.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301028161/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3305317741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110298#issuecomment-3305317741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110298","id":3305317741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FAyVt","user":{"login":"0xcafeb33f","id":17749567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQ5NTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17749567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f","html_url":"https://github.com/0xcafeb33f","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xcafeb33f/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T03:47:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T03:47:56Z","body":"I investigated the non-uniform magnitudes scaling case, and I don't think it is worth the tradeoff to implement. The primary problem with non-uniform magnitude scaling is not that the bone lengths are cached (there was actually already a scaling adjustment to the cached length prior to this PR), but instead that the scaling is applied *after the skeleton modifications*. In short: with non-uniform magnitude scaling, bone length changes *as a function of angle*. This relationship breaks many of the fundamental assumptions of the Skeleton2D node, making it unreasonable to try to implement a fix.\r\n\r\nThe CCDIK modifier tracks the target node accurately in non-uniform magnitude scales by fixing the bone lengths, which is unclear if it is the desired behavior. For completeness, the issue of FABRIK not working correctly has been previously reported in #75224.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3305317741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329153342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110298#issuecomment-3329153342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110298","id":3329153342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gbtk-","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T15:04:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T15:04:56Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329153342/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3334602135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110298#issuecomment-3334602135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110298","id":3334602135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gwf2X","user":{"login":"rjunkfolder-del","id":229520140,"node_id":"U_kgDODa4zDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229520140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del","html_url":"https://github.com/rjunkfolder-del","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjunkfolder-del/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":fal